## Styler Tests

### Styler

What to test:

- Each radius key (tank, damage, healer) renders with its distinct stroke, fill, dash and marker shape.
- Hovering a series triggers no marker overrides beyond the styler's own output.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler" name="styler" type="generated" /%}

### Styler & Item Styler

What to test:

- Series-level styler colours apply to all markers in a series.
- The "Intelligence" datum on the healer series, the "Vitality" datum on the tank series and the "Agility" datum on the damage series render with their gold item-styler overrides.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler & Item Styler" name="styler-and-itemstyler" type="generated" /%}

### Styler Highlight State

What to test:

- Hover a single marker; that marker enlarges and its sibling series fades.
- Hover a legend item; the matching series highlights while the other dims to the unhighlighted-series styling.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler Highlight State" name="styler-highlight-state" type="generated" /%}
